<title>UK: ED&amp;F Man buys Cargill Mollases.</title>
<headline>ED&amp;F Man buys Cargill Mollases.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ED&amp;F Man Group plc, the international agricultural products and financial services group, said on Wednesday it had agreed to acquire from Cargill Incorporated Cargill's Molasses Liquid Products Division (&quot;MLPD&quot;), a worldwide molasses and animal liquid feed business.</p>
<p>Man is paying $48.5 million , 30 million stg, in cash at completion. In addition, Man will acquire the inventory and trade receivables of MLPD, which will be valued at the closing date and are estimated to be about $50m (31 million stg).</p>
</text>
